{"title":"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Choose four numbers by circling exactly one number in each horizontal row, and one number in each vertical column.\nCompute the product of these four numbers. Explain clearly why the same product results no matter which selection \nof this type of four numbers you make.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/f/76fed477a4de2d3ce8ef324a91f02235365d0fe6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{|cccc|} \\hline 10 &amp; 15 &amp; 35 &amp; 20 \\\\ 2&amp; 3&amp; 7&amp; 4\\\\ 8&amp; 12&amp; 28&amp; 16\\\\ 12&amp; 18&amp; 42&amp; 24\\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"81\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that, within each row, all four numbers are in the same ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/2/712c4351db806761187d2a2d97d759e41995b1db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:3:7:4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />, and that, within each column, all four numbers are in the same ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cee621926d4d7c930a1a43e86e973048ae1381.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5:1:4:6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />. If we align the ratio of numbers in the same row horizontally above the table and align the ratio of numbers in the same column vertically to the next of the table, we see that each entry in the table can be found by multiplying its corresponding row \"factor\" and column \"factor\". \n</p><p>If exactly one number is being taken from each row, then each row \"factor\" will be used exactly once. In the same way, if exactly one number is taken from each column, then each column \"factor\" will be used exactly once. Thus, no matter which numbers you choose, you will always end up multiplying all the row factors together, along with all the column factors, meaning your product will always be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82fe7a265bf6833327d39e02f9510ed8ceea1007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 * 3 * 7 * 4 * 5 * 1 * 4 * 6 = 20,160$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"270\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, the product is invariant.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II\">1993 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017044609\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 78/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 94/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 878/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.838      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    6.838      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13622:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017044609 and revision id 113375. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}